# Deliberate line endings.
#
# The project standardises on LF in the repository for all text. The project's
# PowerShell tooling is newline-agnostic — it does not depend on CRLF — so
# normalising to LF is safe across the toolchain.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Text formats: always LF in the working tree and in the repository.
*.md text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.txt text eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.def text eol=lf
*.bat text eol=lf

# Binary formats: never normalise, never diff as text.
*.co binary
*.fatbin binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.bin binary
*.o binary
*.obj binary
*.lib binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
